# Plan: T-162-LIVE-032 Fix — MCP Advanced + Nervous Tools READ-ONLY Audit

## Goal
Produce single audit report at docs/audits/sprint-162-live/T-162-LIVE-032-mcp-advanced-nervous.md
covering MCP tools: feature_query, recover, docs, memory_query, sync, config,
nervous_subscribe/accept/reject/status/config (5 tools).

## Approach
1. Enumerate src/mcp/tools/ to identify which tool files exist
2. Read each tool file and helpers/resources used by them
3. Apply 10 audit dimensions to each
4. Lead questions: ADR-040 nervous accept/reject wire, MCP feature query manifest
5. Write single report with Scope, Findings (P0..P3), Evidence (file:line),
   Migration triage (KEEP-PRIVATE | MIGRATE-PUBLIC | DELETE-CANDIDATE | UNCERTAIN),
   Recommendation per file/area

## Constraints
- READ-ONLY — only docs/audits/sprint-162-live/T-162-LIVE-032-*.md may be written
- Workers MUST NOT touch src/, .deckent/, .brain/, tests/
- ADR-037 RBAC + ADR-039 self-modifying detector active

